      "decay_ic_5d": 0.0291101152,
      "decay_ic_20d": 0.0145582583,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Strong in 2028-2029 (IC 0.11783 and 0.06888), negative in 2031 recent observations (recent 180-session IC -0.01460; recent 60-session IC -0.19434 based on only 9 observations). Admission passes benchmark absolute IC 0.0070 and absolute ICIR 0.0840, but recent drift warrants conservative use and revalidation.",
    "artifacts": {"signal": "scripts/miner_3_20311030_dispersion_reversal_signal.csv", "ic": "scripts/miner_3_20311030_dispersion_reversal_ic.csv"}
